      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none" data-aos="fade-up">
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose text-lg mb-6">A mini skincare fridge is the ultimate beauty accessory for anyone who wants to extend the shelf life of their products and enjoy a refreshing application every morning. Cool temperatures help preserve active ingredients like vitamin C, retinol, and peptides, preventing them from breaking down under heat and light. This article features the 10 most popular mini skincare fridges of 2026, from budget-friendly options to professional-grade models.</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>Product Comparison Table</h2>
