          <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold text-dark-bg">Key Features</th>
        </tr></thead><tbody class="divide-y divide-border">
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#1</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">Kalroute Mini Fridge</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$49.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">4L</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Large capacity, quiet compressor</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#2</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">Clikix Pro Skincare Fridge</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$89.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">8L</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Professional grade, precise temp</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#3</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">MISTY Beauty Fridge</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$69.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">6L</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Stylish design, LED lamp</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#4</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">COSMELLE Mini Cooler</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$119.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">5L</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Premium brand, refined build</td></tr>
<tr class="hover:bg-cream transition-colors"><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="font-bold text-gold-primary">#5</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 font-semibold">Vicomfy Mini Fridge</td><td class="px-4 py-4">$34.99</td><td class="px-4 py-4">3L</td><td class="px-4 py-4"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★☆</span></td><td class="px-4 py-4 text-secondary">Budget-friendly, compact</td></tr>
        </tbody></table></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>Detailed Reviews</h2>
        <div class="space-y-12"><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">1</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Kalroute Mini Fridge</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$49.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The Kalroute Mini Fridge stands out as our top pick for most users. Its 4-liter capacity fits a full skincare routine — serums, creams, eye products, and sheet masks — while the whisper-quiet compressor ensures it will not disturb your sleep. At $49.99, it delivers exceptional value without sacrificing performance.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Spacious 4L interior</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Whisper-quiet operation</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">LED interior light</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Affordable price</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">No app control</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Basic temperature range</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">2</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">Clikix Pro Skincare Fridge</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$89.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The Clikix Pro is the premium choice for skincare enthusiasts who demand precision. With a temperature range of 36-46°F and an impressive 8-liter capacity, it can store not just skincare but also makeup and facial tools. The touch screen control and USB power option make it versatile for any setup.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Precise 36-46°F range</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">8L generous capacity</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Touch screen control</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">USB power option</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Higher price point</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Bulky for small vanity</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-2xl p-8"><div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-4"><span class="font-playfair text-4xl font-bold text-gold-primary">3</span><div class="flex-1"><h3 class="font-playfair text-xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-2">MISTY Beauty Fridge</h3><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3"><span class="text-gold-primary">★★★★★</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-muted">|</span><span class="font-inter text-sm text-gold-primary font-semibold">$69.99</span></div></div></div><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">The MISTY Beauty Fridge combines function with stunning aesthetics. Its retro-inspired design comes in multiple colors, making it a beautiful addition to any vanity. The 6-liter capacity and soft LED lighting create a luxurious experience every time you open the door.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-3 mb-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Beautiful retro design</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">6L capacity</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Soft LED lighting</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A4C" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14"/><polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Multiple color options</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">Plastic interior shelves</span></div><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#6B6B6B" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/><line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/></svg><span class="font-inter text-sm text-secondary">No digital display</span></div></div><a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon &rarr;</a></div></div>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>How We Chose</h2>
        <p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-loose mb-6">Our editorial team tested over 10 mini skincare fridge models over three months. We evaluated each unit on cooling performance, temperature consistency, noise levels, capacity, build quality, and user feedback from verified purchasers. All products were purchased at retail price to ensure unbiased reviews.</p>
        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mt-12 mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-gold-primary"></span>FAQ</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6"><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: Do skincare fridges really work?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">Yes. Scientific studies confirm that cooler temperatures slow the degradation of active ingredients like vitamin C and retinol. A skincare fridge kept at 36-46°F can extend product shelf life by 2-3x compared to room temperature storage.</p></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: What temperature should a skincare fridge be set to?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">We recommend setting your skincare fridge between 36-46°F (2-8°C). This range preserves active ingredients without freezing water-based products. Avoid temperatures below 32°F as they can damage emulsions and serums.</p></div><div class="bg-cream rounded-xl p-6"><h3 class="font-playfair font-semibold text-lg text-dark-bg mb-2">Q: Can I store makeup in a skincare fridge?</h3><p class="font-inter text-secondary">Absolutely. Most skincare fridges are perfect for storing foundation, concealer, mascara, and eye creams. The cool temperature helps preserve pigments and prevent bacterial growth in cosmetic products.</p></div></div>
        <div class="mt-12 p-8 bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-primary/10 to-gold-light/10 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-gold-primary"><h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl font-bold text-dark-bg mb-4">Final Verdict</h2><p class="font-inter text-secondary leading-relaxed mb-4">For most users, the <strong>Kalroute Mini Fridge</strong> at $49.99 offers the best balance of capacity, performance, and value. If you want professional-grade precision, the <strong>Clikix Pro</strong> at $89.99 is worth the investment. For style-focused buyers, the <strong>MISTY Beauty Fridge</strong> delivers both function and beauty.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 mt-6"><a href="#" class="btn-gold text-sm">Check Price on Amazon</a><a href="/blog" class="btn-gold-outline text-sm">More Reviews</a></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>